// Shumway debugger - registration that the [Provide*] attributes cannot express.
//
// A TextMate grammar REPOSITORY: VS scans the folder, reads each grammar's own fileTypes,
// and colours those extensions. That is the whole .pl colorizer -- no editor factory, no
// language service, no content type.
[$RootKey$\TextMate\Repositories]
"Shumway"="$PackageFolder$\Grammars"
